os.remove()
This method removes (deletes) the file at the given path.
The MQL5 built-in function
FileDelete()
becomes the foundation of the method remove() below.
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//| Deletes a file from the MQL5 file sandbox.                       |
//|                                                                  |
//| The file must be located within the terminal's Files folder or   |
//| within the common Files folder when is_common_path is set to     |
//| true.                                                            |
//|                                                                  |
//| parameters:                                                      |
//|   path  -  Name or path of the file to be deleted.               |
//|                                                                  |
//|   is_common_path  - Whether the file is located in the common    |
//|                     folder or under the terminal's Files folder. |
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
bool
COS::remove(
const
string
path,
bool
is_common_path =
false
)
  {
return
FileDelete
(path, is_common_path ?
FILE_COMMON
:
0
);
  }
